==Version history==
During [[Tempest league]], tempests were globally set for each area, and randomized hourly. Not all areas had a tempest each hour, but the chance for spawning one was 50%. Existing instance of an area retained old tempests. After Tempest league ended, tempests were not added to the core game.

Several types of tempests were also available via [[Prophecy|prophecies]] (which have been removed from the game). Tempests were also offered as a [[Map Device]] craft option. It was last made available in [[Version 2.3.0]] and has not returned since.
